>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>12/11/2025</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b> 12/11/2025</b></li>\n<li>Correction Last Date :<b>17/11/2025</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date Start :<b>28/01/2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available :<b> Before Exam </b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available :<b> 09/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Result Available : <strong>31/08/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"376\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b> </b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / Other State : <b>560/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / OBC : <b>310/-</b></li>\n<li>Portal Charge : <b>60/- (Include)</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Cash at KIOSK Or Pay Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode Only</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>MPESB Group 2 Sub Group 3 Combined Recruitment 2025 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/01/2025</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>18 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per MP ESB Group 2 Sub Group 3 Combined Test Various Post Recruitment Rules 2025.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>MP ESB <b>Group 2 Sub Group 3 Various</b> Post </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Vacancy Details Total : 454 Post</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"244\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Exam Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"120\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"435\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>MPESB Group 2 Sub Group 3 Various Post Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"244\">\n<p align=\"center\">Various Post Under Group-2 Sub Group-3 Combined Recruitment Test – 2025</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"120\">\n<p align=\"center\">454</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"435\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree / Diploma&nbsp; in Related Trade / Branch in Any Recognized Institute in India.</li>\n<li>For Post Wise Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">MPESB Group II Sub Group III Post</span> Recruitment 2025 Exam City Details</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Balaghat, Bhopal, Gwalior, Indore, Jabalpur, Khandwa, Neemach, Ratlam, Rewa, Sagar, Satna, Sidhi &amp; Ujjain.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill MP ESB <b>Group 1 Sub Group 3</b> Recruitment Online Form 2025</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recruitment of Madhya Pradesh ESB for the posts of MP ESB Group 2 Sub Group<b> 3</b> Various Post Combined Recruitment Test – 2025 Rules. The applications of Recruitment will be online from <b>29 October 2025 to 12 November 2025</b>.</li>\n<li>Along with Madhya Pradesh, candidates from other states can also apply (As per MPESB Group 2 Sub Group 3 Various Post Recruitment Rules) .</li>\n<li>To apply in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, the candidate has to first create a profile of himself. To create a profile, the candidate wants to have Aadhar card number and also want to have registered mobile number in it, only then there will be E-KYC in the profile, those whose mobile number is not registered, they will have to create a profile through biometric through MP Online Kiosk. .</li>\n<li>For the application of recruitment in Madhya Pradesh Professional Board, along with the profile, all the candidates will also have to register in the Madhya Pradesh Employment Office.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\"><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n<p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full MPESB Group II Sub Group III Post Notification 2025 Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Result</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"MPESB Group II Sub Group III Result\" href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/results/RESULT_25/Group2_SG3_RES25/default_Results.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Answer Key</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"MPESB Group II Sub Group III Answer Key\" href=\"https://g2sg3crt25.cbtexam.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Admit Card Part II</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"MPESB Group II Sub Group III Admit Card\" href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/tacs/tac_2025/GROUP_2_SG3_TAC25/default_tac.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"col